  "description": "Connects the OASIS to the XRP Ledger -- purpose-built for payments and tokenisation, delivering 3-5 second settlement, 1,500 TPS, near-zero fees, and a carbon-neutral consensus protocol. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and XRP/IOU tokens. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
